    "long_instructions": "## Smart Home Automation\r\n\r\n1. Label each diamond with a condition.\r\n2. Add true/false labels to each branch and connect to four outcomes.\r\n3. Make sure each outcome matches what you'd expect from your truth table.\r\n4. Export your flowchart as a PNG for the next level.\r\n\r\n",
